                      "color": "#1B2A38"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left",
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The price band is a sourced assumption. The dollar figure is an upper bound: it assumes every under-forecast megawatt is bought at that price.",
